小米澎程N90我们在北京五环跑了28个小时，1600公里，绕了五环16圈！这次我们再次直播挑战广州环城高速20圈，现在已经整整20圈了！跑了1209公里，但续航还剩200公里<img data-n=\"weibo-emoji\" alt=\"[允悲]\" src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/weibo?url=https%3A%2F%2Fface.t.sinajs.cn%2Ft4%2Fappstyle%2Fexpression%2Fext%2Fnormal%2F65%2F201810_ybnew_mobile.png\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align:middle\"><img data-n=\"weibo-emoji\" alt=\"[允悲]\" src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/weibo?url=https%3A%2F%2Fface.t.sinajs.cn%2Ft4%2Fappstyle%2Fexpression%2Fext%2Fnormal%2F65%2F201810_ybnew_mobile.png\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align:middle\">看看最后能能绕多少圈吧…希望这次@雷军 雷总能对我好点… ​​​</p><p data-n=\"weibo-image-block\"><img data-n=\"weibo-image\" alt=\"微博图片\" src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/weibo?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwx4.sinaimg.cn%2Forj360%2F008lKQTRgy1ijei9c7banj310o27o1ky.jpg\"></p>","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/weibo?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwx4.sinaimg.cn%2Forj360%2F008lKQTRgy1ijei9c7banj310o27o1ky.jpg","images":["http://script.findrss.cloud/img/weibo?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwx4.sinaimg.cn%2Forj360%2F008lKQTRgy1ijei9c7banj310o27o1ky.jpg"],"kind":"post","author":"大鹏快开车","published":"2026-11-25T08:13:00.000Z"}}]},{"id":"5369203294997788","title":"广东四城交车，爽哥辛苦了。","link":"https://weibo.com/1749127163/Rt2idkY9u","description":"广东四城交车，爽哥辛苦了。","content":"<p>广东四城交车，爽哥辛苦了。</p>","images":[],"kind":"repost","author":"雷军","published":"2026-11-25T10:08:03.000Z","references":[{"relation":"repost","id":"5369170096555758","link":"https://weibo.com/4073292684/Rt1qFrvs2","item":{"id":"5369170096555758","title":"两天，四城，#小米澎程#广东交付圆满收官。\n从深圳到东莞，从佛山到广州，一路与更多广东车主见面，见证大家提车时的期待与喜悦。\n\n现场有不少油车升级的用户，看中增程带来的省心与便利，喜欢智能化体验：城市","link":"https://weibo.com/4073292684/Rt1qFrvs2","description":"两天，四城，#小米澎程#广东交付圆满收官。\n从深圳到东莞，从佛山到广州，一路与更多广东车主见面，见证大家提车时的期待与喜悦。\n\n现场有不少油车升级的用户，看中增程带来的省心与便利，喜欢智能化体验：城市通勤可以用电，长途出行有油保底，还能加92号油，续航和补能都更踏实；智能泊车、辅助驾驶 ​​​","content":"<p>两天，四城，#小米澎程#广东交付圆满收官。<br>从深圳到东莞，从佛山到广州，一路与更多广东车主见面，见证大家提车时的期待与喜悦。<br><br>现场有不少油车升级的用户，看中增程带来的省心与便利，喜欢智能化体验：城市通勤可以用电，长途出行有油保底，还能加92号油，续航和补能都更踏实；智能泊车、辅助驾驶 ​​​</p><p data-n=\"weibo-image-block\"><img data-n=\"weibo-image\" alt=\"微博图片\" src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/weibo?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwx2.sinaimg.cn%2Forj360%2Ff2c9838cly1ijehpa2xqzj20qn0zktvr.jpg\"></p><p data-n=\"weibo-image-block\"><img data-n=\"weibo-image\" alt=\"微博图片\" src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/weibo?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwx1.sinaimg.cn%2Forj360%2Ff2c9838cly1ijehpa1yeoj20qn0zknk0.jpg\"></p><p data-n=\"weibo-image-block\"><img data-n=\"weibo-image\" alt=\"微博图片\" src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/weibo?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwx3.sinaimg.cn%2Forj360%2Ff2c9838cly1ijehpa1uszj20qn0zknjf.jpg\"></p><p data-n=\"weibo-image-block\"><img data-n=\"weibo-image\" alt=\"微博图片\" src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/weibo?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwx4.sinaimg.cn%2Forj360%2Ff2c9838cly1ijehpa1w80j20qn0zktuk.jpg\"></p>","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/weibo?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwx2.sinaimg.cn%2Forj360%2Ff2c9838cly1ijehpa2xqzj20qn0zktvr.jpg","images":["http://script.findrss.cloud/img/weibo?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwx2.sinaimg.cn%2Forj360%2Ff2c9838cly1ijehpa2xqzj20qn0zktvr.jpg","http://script.findrss.cloud/img/weibo?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwx1.sinaimg.cn%2Forj360%2Ff2c9838cly1ijehpa1yeoj20qn0zknk0.jpg","http://script.findrss.cloud/img/weibo?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwx3.sinaimg.cn%2Forj360%2Ff2c9838cly1ijehpa1uszj20qn0zknjf.jpg","http://script.findrss.cloud/img/weibo?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwx4.sinaimg.cn%2Forj360%2Ff2c9838cly1ijehpa1w80j20qn0zktuk.jpg"],"kind":"post","author":"小米澎程","published":"2026-11-25T07:56:08.000Z"}}]},{"id":"5369190909218680","title":"广州车展 [酷]","link":"https://weibo.com/1749127163/Rt1YeCGco","description":"广州车展 [酷]","content":"<p>广州车展 <img data-n=\"weibo-emoji\" alt=\"[酷]\" src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/weibo?url=https%3A%2F%2Fface.t.sinajs.cn%2Ft4%2Fappstyle%2Fexpression%2Fext%2Fnormal%2Faf%2F201810_ku_mobile.png\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align:middle\"></p>","images":[],"kind":"repost","author":"雷军","published":"2026-11-25T09:18:50.000Z","references":[{"relation":"repost","id":"5369186168866222","link":"https://weibo.com/7871239944/Rt1QABcvA","item":{"id":"5369186168866222","title":"2026小米汽车广州国际车展，全系车型集中亮相，这份逛展攻略请收好。\n\n逛展时间：媒体日11.27、公众日11.28-12.6\n现场福利：定制爆米花、饮用水等你来领，数量有限，先到先得\n趣味体验：二排","link":"https://weibo.com/7871239944/Rt1QABcvA","description":"2026小米汽车广州国际车展，全系车型集中亮相，这份逛展攻略请收好。\n\n逛展时间：媒体日11.27、公众日11.28-12.6\n现场福利：定制爆米花、饮用水等你来领，数量有限，先到先得\n趣味体验：二排空间“巨无霸”大挑战，欢迎来玩\n\n每日还有展区专业讲解，来D区17号馆 · 17202展位，一起交流、看车！ ​​​","content":"<p>2026小米汽车广州国际车展，全系车型集中亮相，这份逛展攻略请收好。<br><br>逛展时间：媒体日11.27、公众日11.28-12.6<br>现场福利：定制爆米花、饮用水等你来领，数量有限，先到先得<br>趣味体验：二排空间“巨无霸”大挑战，欢迎来玩<br><br>每日还有展区专业讲解，来D区17号馆 · 17202展位，一起交流、看车！ ​​​</p><p data-n=\"weibo-image-block\"><img data-n=\"weibo-image\" alt=\"微博图片\" src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/weibo?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwx4.sinaimg.cn%2Forj360%2F008AGV4Yly1ijehsyr3uwj31401hctjh.jpg\"></p><p data-n=\"weibo-image-block\"><img data-n=\"weibo-image\" alt=\"微博图片\" src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/weibo?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwx3.sinaimg.cn%2Forj360%2F008AGV4Yly1ijeht14odxj31401hcqqo.jpg\"></p><p data-n=\"weibo-image-block\"><img data-n=\"weibo-image\" alt=\"微博图片\" src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/weibo?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwx3.sinaimg.cn%2Forj360%2F008AGV4Yly1ijeht39t22j31401hcnn4.jpg\"></p><p data-n=\"weibo-image-block\"><img data-n=\"weibo-image\" alt=\"微博图片\" src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/weibo?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwx2.sinaimg.cn%2Forj360%2F008AGV4Yly1ijeht63khuj31401hc4qp.jpg\"></p><p data-n=\"weibo-image-block\"><img data-n=\"weibo-image\" alt=\"微博图片\" src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/weibo?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwx3.sinaimg.cn%2Forj360%2F008AGV4Yly1ijeht8t1phj31401hckj7.jpg\"></p><p data-n=\"weibo-image-block\"><img data-n=\"weibo-image\" alt=\"微博图片\" src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/weibo?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwx1.sinaimg.cn%2Forj360%2F008AGV4Yly1ijehtgc9waj31401hcb21.jpg\"></p><p data-n=\"weibo-image-block\"><img data-n=\"weib